      "changelog": "Quiet Vercel polls no longer leak their notes into the chat: OpenClaw delivers stderr alongside NO_REPLY, so a successful scheduled run now writes its notes to web-observer.log beside the state file. Error alerts name the project and its domain and list each distinct error once, with count, routes, status, whether it was an HTTP failure, and a sample request id. Opted-in log messages are cut to one line, capped, and have common secret shapes redacted.",
